 "title": "Extended ideal along a morphism",
 "statement": "For $f\\colon Y\\to X$ and a quasi-coherent ideal\n$\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal O_X$, define\n$\\mathcal I\\mathcal O_Y$ to be the image ideal of the composite\n\n$$\nf^*\\mathcal I\\longrightarrow f^*\\mathcal O_X\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal O_Y.\n$$",
